cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, cite the exact archived release or Git commit that you checked."
title: "Lean formalization of completely regular growth for exponential-polynomial differential equations"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Xing-Yu"
version: "1.0.1"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalizations of all seven numbered theorem, proposition, and
  corollary statements of the manuscript, including Theorem 1.1: every transcendental entire finite-order
  solution of a monic linear differential equation with exponential-polynomial
  coefficients has positive rational order, finite nonzero type, and completely
  regular growth. Includes the required Gundersen angular estimates, rational
  ray normal form, Phragmen-Lindelof connections, and constant-order Levin
  criterion with C0 exceptional disks and the unrestricted indicator.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - entire functions
  - ordinary differential equations
  - completely regular growth
repository-code: "https://github.com/xyli9596/crg-growth-and-zero-distribution"
